flowchart LR
  A[Isolated CBDC design claims] --> B[Cross-property conflicts]
  B --> C[Unsupported system-level assurance]
  C --> D[Premature deployment or policy claims]
  E[Claim specification] --> F[Evidence origin and maturity]
  G[Negative controls and failure envelope] --> F
  H[Reproducible model prototype and analysis] --> F
  F --> I{Non-compensating gate}
  I -->|evidence sufficient| J[Advance only the bounded claim]
  I -->|missing failed or contradictory| K[Narrow redesign or stop]
  J --> L[Physical and governed field evidence when required]
  K --> E
